          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT f.period_end::timestamp AS \"time\", m.label AS metric, f.value\nFROM listing_facts('${ticker:raw}', 'pit', '${currency:raw}', ARRAY['TotalAssets', 'TotalLiabilities', 'StockholdersEquity', 'TotalDebt']) f\nJOIN (VALUES ('TotalAssets', 'total assets'), ('TotalLiabilities', 'total liabilities'), ('StockholdersEquity', 'stockholders'' equity'), ('TotalDebt', 'total debt')) AS m(item, label) USING (item)\nORDER BY 1"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Total assets, liabilities, stockholders' equity and total debt (every borrowing line, current and non-current) from the balance sheet. Market cap against book value is in the valuation row below."
